  "worked_solution": "The mode of a random variable $X$ with probability density function $f(x)$ is the value of $x$ at the global maxima of $f(x).$\n\nFrom the graph, we can tell that $f(x)$ has a single global maximum at $x=7.$\n\nTherefore, the mode of $X$ is $7.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14158570/assets/a814c66be550f9850a9807a19d3f0dc836b3fba08c2cd3b451dc00f94b3e4d24.png)",
